WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:02.660
You were given a number of days

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:04.820
not unlimited

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:05.900
numbered

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:10.260
So be careful how you live not as unwise, but as wise

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.860
Redeeming the time

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:16.100
For most of history an idea cost you years

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:18.700
Years you did not have

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:22.220
There are four levels of value in this world

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:29.180
The first is physical your back it pays the least the second is managerial your systems

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:33.740
The third is communication your words and at the top

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:38.300
Imagination the only one a machine cannot do for you

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:43.600
So let the machines do machine work and you go back to your life

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:48.500
To the dog to the water to the people at your table

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:52.820
What used to take you years now takes weeks

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:59.430
The kingdom of heaven is like a grain of mustard seed

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:07.790
The smallest of all seeds and it becomes a tree and the birds of the air come and nest in its branches

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:12.670
God is raising an army to establish his ways in the land

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:17.870
Not to consume what someone else made to create what he put in you

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:22.790
So bring the wild one the one you stop saying out loud

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:26.290
It is a wonderful time to be alive

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:30.930
Modern Mustard Seed let's build the tree
